		</Tool><Tool Revision="23.1.0" option="0"><ItemID idValue="{9B8A653B-24EB-46A1-89DB-6E617E706518}"/><Properties><ItemName>Reveal</ItemName><Images option="0"><Image cx="64" cy="64" IsDark="false" src="..\..\Images\light\reveal.png"/><Image cx="64" cy="64" IsDark="true" src="..\..\Images\dark\reveal.png"/></Images><Description>Reveal</Description><ToolTip>The reveal tool is used to delineate a desired reveal along the edge of a building pad. A reveal can only be added to a building pad object. The reveal tool adds properties to the building pad that indicate the minimum and maximum desired elevation difference between the building pad elevation and the surrounding terrain surface.</ToolTip><Help><HelpFile>https://help.autodesk.com/view/C3DGO/ENU/?contextId=id_dlg_tool_prop_reveal</HelpFile><HelpCommand>HELP_BROWSER_URL</HelpCommand></Help><Time createdUniversalDateTime="2020-10-13T00:02:11" modifiedUniversalDateTime="2020-10-13T17:05:12"/></Properties><Source/><ToolType>1</ToolType><StockToolRef idValue="{7531530D-1031-4BAC-ABB4-357D46D6B92B}"/><Data>
