		</Tool><Tool Revision="23.1.0" option="0"><ItemID idValue="{38C2B58C-ECA6-4DEA-983A-59DBBD871434}"/><Properties><ItemName>Bend Line</ItemName><Images option="0"><Image cx="64" cy="64" IsDark="false" src="..\..\Images\light\Bend_line.png"/><Image cx="64" cy="64" IsDark="true" src="..\..\Images\dark\Bend_line.png"/></Images><Description>Bend Line</Description><ToolTip>A bend line attempts to relax the slope of surface triangles along a line. Surface triangle edges that touch a bend line will be set to a minimum slope elevation of zero and a maximum slope elevation of infinity.</ToolTip><Help><HelpFile>https://help.autodesk.com/view/C3DGO/ENU/?contextId=id_dlg_tool_prop_bend_line</HelpFile><HelpCommand>HELP_BROWSER_URL</HelpCommand></Help><Time createdUniversalDateTime="2020-09-04T11:56:37" modifiedUniversalDateTime="2020-09-04T11:56:37"/></Properties><ToolType>1</ToolType><StockToolRef idValue="{CBD72E4C-0F8B-4CD5-9DEE-866A1FE8175D}"/><Data>
